!Platform_description = Please use the GEO Data Submission Report Plug-in v1.0 for Gene Expression which may be downloaded from https://icom.illumina.com/icom/software.ilmn?id=234 to format the normalized and raw data.  These should be submitted as part of a GEOarchive.  Instructions for assembling a GEOarchive may be found at http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/projects/geo/info/spreadsheet.html
